{"4260600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CORALINA - illacrimo", "steam_appid": 4260600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260600/extras/f14a57cb2a2f4975deb2ec883f216310.avif?t=1767648555\" width=1364 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ILLACRIMO&quot; is the last chapter in the story of the girl that followed a talking Crow through the confines of Limbo, the Land of Oblivion. After crossing a maze of lost memories, making friends with the dead, and discovering the Wonders of Alchemy, Cora now finds herself in the middle of a surreal odissey in this psychedelic world that mixes different art styles to create a unique and charming sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260600/extras/184199edbcb0565a08dfbb11cb741af8.avif?t=1767648555\" width=1364 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing through the maze of memories of Limbo, and through the flowery ruins of Purgatory, the girl in red now goes to Hell, the end of her journey. Beside her is Cometa, a mysterious purple-haired woman, their mission is to find the Iron Alchemist's Mask before the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this narrative driven game with puzzles, exploration, diverse art styles and stunning visuals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260600/extras/5ea6940315eb1ce019b17c1c4f462640.avif?t=1767648555\" width=1364 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Coralina - illacrimo&quot; is a retro RPG-style game with pixel art graphics and easy-to-understand mechanics, based on exploring the environment, interacting with NPCs, and solving puzzles to progress through the story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260600/extras/f14a57cb2a2f4975deb2ec883f216310.avif?t=1767648555\" width=1364 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ILLACRIMO&quot; is the last chapter in the story of the girl that followed a talking Crow through the confines of Limbo, the Land of Oblivion. After crossing a maze of lost memories, making friends with the dead, and discovering the Wonders of Alchemy, Cora now finds herself in the middle of a surreal odissey in this psychedelic world that mixes different art styles to create a unique and charming sight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4260600/extras/184199edbcb0565a08dfbb11cb741af8.avif?t=1767648555\" width=1364 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing through the maze of memories of Limbo, and through the flowery ruins of Purgatory, the girl in red now goes to Hell, the end of her journey. Beside her is Cometa, a mysterious purple-haired woman, their mission is to find the Iron Alchemist's Mask before the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy this narrative driven game with puzzles, exploration, diverse art styles and stunning visuals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati